Keep small UMAP ordering and t-SNE API adapters around their wrappers.

Use installed SciPy for PCA/SVD; no numerical algorithm is copied or replaced.
Restore temporary bindings after UMAP/t-SNE returns or raises, including nested
calls. Other commands retain standard dependency behavior. This limits output
drift but does not promise identical PCA values or embedding layouts.

--- a/scanpy_scripts/_legacy_numerics.py
+++ b/scanpy_scripts/_legacy_numerics.py
